# ThreadSanitizer: what isn't Kompoz's own code and isn't built with it.
#
# Mesa's drivers on the CPU (lavapipe for Vulkan, llvmpipe for OpenGL ES, in libgallium or a library of their own) and
# the LLVM they compile shaders with run threads of their own and synchronize them in code ThreadSanitizer doesn't
# see; what they free, copy or lock through its interceptors is reported as racing with their own threads. Without the
# API's validation (CI's TSan job runs without it) none of them calls back into Kompoz, so a report with their frames
# is theirs.
race:libvulkan_lvp.so
race:libgallium
race:libLLVM
deadlock:libLLVM
